 the components of $x=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]$ and $y=[\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{aligned}]?$" :question/worked-solution "**Method 1**\n\nEach entry ${a}_{ij}$ of $A$ corresponds to the term ${a}_{ij}{x}_{i}{y}_{j}$ in the expression of the bilinear form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{T}\\,Ay & =(-2){x}_{1}{y}_{1}+1{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+(-1){x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2} \\\\  & =-2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+{x}_{1}{y}_{2}-{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nTo write down a bilinear form in terms of vector components, we compute the following expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{T}\\,Ay & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2{y}_{1}+{y}_{2} \\\\ -{y}_{1}+3{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={x}_{1}(-2{y}_{1}+{y}_{2})+{x}_{2}(-{y}_{1}+3{y}_{2}) \\\\  & =-2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+{x}_{1}{y}_{2}-{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-93984/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "55277d69-eedc-5c5c-883a-083746e00947"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-93984"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-93995/selection/5bab21cd5d36fbac1ac486cdc8e6aa2b1bf9ac6386cc135ca435bcad825d7c5f" :answer/id #uuid "28f8b3f4-789a-581b-aa89-f64d171295d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}-{x}_{1}{y}_{2}-{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93995/selection/5d40977ae9e67950552525f40870c3ab99db3a39aa267af029489f7a4c3cfc2a" :answer/id #uuid "5f334a45-0edf-5832-ad38-444ecdf017b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{1}{y}_{1}-2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}-{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93995/selection/c1caddc467801a5e570dfb0