${a}_{ij}$ of $A$ corresponds to the term ${a}_{ij}{x}_{i}{y}_{j}$ in the expression of the bilinear form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{T}\\,Ay & =2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+1{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{2} \\\\  & =2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nTo write down a bilinear form in terms of vector components, we compute the following expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{T}\\,Ay & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2{y}_{1}+3{y}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}+2{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={x}_{1}(2{y}_{1}+3{y}_{2})+{x}_{2}({y}_{1}+2{y}_{2}) \\\\  & =2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-93983/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "55277d69-eedc-5c5c-883a-083746e00947"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-93983"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-93996/selection/83614414e575d578d20fbacd82837c898ca087ea8c67338fc65fdbf3649732f9" :answer/id #uuid "365f0af1-3684-5d62-9e7c-388a8b5a1ac6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}-2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93996/selection/b48ebd8e1907c8e65b24424044f699fb9a92037e9e8e84165cfc43e9c0324112" :answer/id #uuid "6721e169-08ad-5727-9d9c-89daaf3879db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}-2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}-2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-93996/selection/5be9fc5184dd5857cdbe8b99ea67f159c9e228ee2bf31b6fd63e0e717a68bda6" :answer/id #uuid "135513f5-0dde-5018-a4d6-3acd03527453" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}_{1}{y}_{1}-2{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+3{x}_